<title>POLAND: Universal Q1 net rises to PLN 3.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Universal Q1 net rises to PLN 3.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.67 vs	1.06 loss</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   6.33 vs	2.66</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.27 vs	1.54</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Universal SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 25.53 vs     22.45</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  22.22 vs     17.32</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				  na  vs	0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				3.06 vs	1.06</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    19.25 vs     13.29</p>
<p>    financial costs			 13.60 vs	9.56</p>
<p>    investment				 2.20 vs	0.54</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
